Package: chuhi
Type: Package
Title: Outcome-Anchored Validation Harness for City Health Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("City Health Index Audit", "Contributors", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A domain-specific validation layer for auditing in-use city health
    composite indices. Provides paired score construction (with and without
    health outcomes), criterion and predictive validity comparison, bootstrap
    uncertainty, Monte Carlo grade stability and dictionary utilities. Generic
    composite-indicator construction and global sensitivity analysis are
    delegated to the 'COINr' package; this package does not reimplement them.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: COINr, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Notes: Skeleton release. Maintainer email is a placeholder; replace before CRAN/JOSS submission.
